  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll FAQs\n\n### How to submit a Period of Inactivity\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 17 Nov, 2021 at 11:53 AM\n\n\t\tLocation:\n\nSubmissions > FPS & EPS > Click on the Employer Payment Summary > Add Submission\n\nVideo Tutorial:\n\nClick here to watch how to submit a period of inactivity \n\nHelp Guide:\n\nThere are two options for adding a period of inactivity:\n\n\"Period of Inactivity\" - submit for the future period. \n\n\"No Payment for the Period' - submit for the current period\n\nPlease refer below screenshot for more help.\n\nIf it's the final submission, you can click on the button below:\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
