=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">\"Period of Inactivity\" - submit for the future period.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">\"No Payment for the Period' - submit for the current period</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please refer below screenshot for more help.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074210543/original/-EAz17q9XE0JUFc1fVNV2zbr0odEN2om9Q.png?1553594410\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074210543/original/-EAz17q9XE0JUFc1fVNV2zbr0odEN2om9Q.png?1553594410\" data-fileid=\"9074210543\" data-uniquekey=\"1553594401533\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">If it's the final submission, you can click on the button below:</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9144768876/original/z8eE92zibcekrnH3PoDQByKcyLykLLoWew.png?1637149967\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9144768876\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165657\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165657/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165657\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\